  "authority_used": "Explicit Goal86 Run: bounded generic mdkg implementation, synthetic local fixtures, read-only independent reviewers and required evidence/projections",
  "scope": {
    "invariant": "Observational Git consumers do not execute configured fsmonitor or clean/process helpers; failed/malformed observations cannot become clean or fresh receipts.",
    "callers": [
      "git inspect",
      "status",
      "fix plan/internal repair reads",
      "validate --changed-only",
      "bundle create/verify",
      "registered child freshness",
      "subgraph audit/upgrade-plan/sync preview",
      "upgrade missing-event guidance"
    ],
    "legitimate_behavior": "Non-Git graphs, native Git/worktrees/submodules/gitdir indirection, unused filters and Boolean attributes, historical snapshots, intended graph writes and unchanged Git staging remain supported.",
    "overlap": "Preserve prior accepted Bug17/35/40 and Bug39 hunks; whole-file hashes bind the combined candidate, not exclusive ownership of every diff hunk."
  },
  "strategy": [
    "Shared internal Git observation helper extracted from existing inspect hardening; core.fsmonitor=false, optional locks disabled, no lazy fetch, strict UTF-8/NUL/porcelain parsing and sanitized failures.",
    "Inventory effective tracked paths and initialized submodules before status; reject active content filters without blanket disabling that could falsify provenance.",
    "Remove command-specific GIT_CONFIG from all observations so config enumeration and native status use the same effective configuration; preserve normal Git configuration environment.",
    "Use check-attr --all to distinguish absent attributes from literal unspecified. Disambiguate Boolean set/unset from literal drivers through hash-object without -w, disabling all executable drivers and requiring success only for the probe; actual status never uses altered filters.",
    "Preserve literal POSIX backslashes in bundle dirty provenance. Recorded HEAD unavailable/mismatch is stale; show still supports historical inspection and native non-Git bundles remain verifiable.",
    "Unknown child source freshness is explicitly stale while integrity-verified imported historical nodes remain readable; fresh-only/actions refuse unknown proof."
  ],
