          "confirmation": "Absent/Boolean attributes now pass; literal named drivers refuse; native controls distinguish actual execution."
        },
        {
          "issue": "Literal backslash bundle path falsely treated as excluded generated directory",
          "confirmation": "Before source.dirty=false despite native modification; regression now requires true and keeps genuine bundle-directory exclusions."
        }
